Fri Nov  6 20:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of Xpdf 4.06
  * Qt6 viewer with printing support (CUPS), A4 paper by default and
    XDG config/state paths
  * Build the internal goo/fofi/splash libraries statically
  * Command line tools split into xpdf-tools, which conflicts with
    poppler-tools (same command names)
  * System-wide /etc/xpdfrc and xpdfrc(5) in xpdf-common
  * Add a desktop file and the upstream SVG icon
